<body data-time="past">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Fret<b>work</b></a>
    <nav class="navlinks"><a href="#pricing">For teams</a><a href="#how">For people</a><a href="/start">Start</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a read</a></nav>
  </div></header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past on">Past</span><span class="tw present">Present</span><span class="tw future">Future</span></div>
        <h1>We fix how <em>your work runs.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Fretwork connects the tools, workflows and AI your team already uses into one system that actually works. Your framing doesn't have to be your foundation.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a free 30-minute call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">How it works</a></div>
        <p class="welcome" hidden>Welcome to Fretwork · The past · <b>Learn</b> from how things were built</p>
      </div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522202176988-66273c2fd55f?w=1400&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A small team working together at laptops" width="1400" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" /></div></div>
      <div class="proof"><div class="wrap proof-grid"><div><b>30</b><span>Days to a working system</span></div><div><b>0</b><span>New tools to buy</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>Human signs off on everything</span></div><div><b>M365</b><span>Microsoft 365 and Power Automate</span></div></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="sec gallery-sec faces"><div class="wrap gallery"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744173-8e7e53415bb0?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A team mapping a process on a whiteboard" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The map</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-5973dc0f32e7?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Two colleagues reviewing a dashboard" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The fix</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521737711867-e3b97375f902?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A team walking through a plan together" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The handoff</figcaption></figure></div></section>
    <section class="sec" id="why"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The problem</p><h2>Your team is the glue<br>between tools that don't talk.</h2></div>
      <div class="pains"><div class="pain"><h3>Inherited</h3><p>You run on tools and habits someone else set up.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Disconnected</h3><p>Nothing talks to anything. People copy and paste all day.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Unmapped</h3><p>Nobody has written down how the work actually flows.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec"><div class="wrap gallery"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A team planning at a whiteboard with sticky notes" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Map the flow</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/img/russ/russ-laptop.jpg" alt="Russ working on a laptop" style="object-position:50% 12%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Connect the tools</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573164574572-cb89e39749b4?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A diverse team around a conference table" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Hand it to the team</figcaption></figure></div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="russ"><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-bw.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Who does the work</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">Twenty years running organizations on Microsoft 365 and Power Automate. Russ looks at how the work really flows before he changes anything.</p><blockquote>Sometimes we meet life where it is, not where we are. We hold that together.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com/writing">Writing</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Look</h3><p>A 30-minute call. We map how your work flows today.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Fix</h3><p>A fixed price. We connect your tools and automate the busywork.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Hand off</h3><p>Your team runs it. No long contract.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h2>Fixed price. No surprises.</h2></div>
      <div class="offers"><div class="offer feat"><div class="tag">Start here</div><h3>The Systems Review</h3><div class="price">Fixed fee</div><p>We look at every tool and hand-off and give you a plan you own.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a call</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">Most chosen</div><h3>The Rebuild</h3><div class="price">Quoted</div><p>We connect, automate and hand off. About 30 days.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Ask</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">Ongoing</div><h3>Keep it running</h3><div class="price">Monthly</div><p>We watch it, fix it, and add to it as you grow.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Ask</a></div></div>
      
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="family"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Past · Present · Future</p><h2>Part of Vault Human.</h2><p class="lede">Fretwork is the pattern under the finish: the systems your work actually runs on. Fretwork is one of three companies behind Vault Human coaching. On its own, Fretwork is a systems shop for teams. It is not coaching and not a law firm.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown me" href="https://www.fretworksystems.com"><div class="when">Learn · The past</div><h3>Fretwork</h3><p>Fixes how your work runs: tools, workflows, AI. Not a coach. Not a law firm.</p><span>fretworksystems.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc green" href="https://triplicityadvisory.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Love · The present</div><h3>Triplicity</h3><p>The coaching company. Runs every Vault Human coaching program.</p><span>triplicityadvisory.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc navy" href="https://www.tercetlaw.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Live · The future</div><h3>Tercet</h3><p>The law firm. Wills, trusts, and a plan for your family. Not coaching.</p><span>tercetlaw.com ↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">The Constant: <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What does Fretwork do?</summary><p>Fixes how your work runs: connects your tools, automates busywork, and hands it to your team.</p></details><details><summary>Do you replace our tools?</summary><p>No. We connect the ones you have.</p></details><details><summary>What is Vault Human?</summary><p>Daily coaching, run by the same owner. Fretwork is the systems side; it is not coaching.</p></details><details><summary>Why 'the past'?</summary><p>Because every system you run today was built in the past. We start there.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final" id="begin"><div class="wrap">
      <h2>See what we see.</h2><p class="lede">A free 30-minute call. We tell you what is broken and what it would cost.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a free 30-minute call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>

