      <ul><li><a href="#pricing">For teams</a></li><li><a href="#how">For people</a></li><li><a href="/start">Start</a></li><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></li></ul>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen</li><li><a href="https://www.fretworksystems.com">Fretwork</a> — Learn · the past</li><li><a href="https://triplicityadvisory.com">Triplicity</a> — Love · the present</li><li><a href="https://www.tercetlaw.com">Tercet Law</a> — Live · the future</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap legal"><span>&copy; {year} Fretwork Systems. Part of the Vault Human family.</span><span>Part of the Vault Human family</span></div>
  </footer>

